    ; pickLongestCandidateSignature, whole. ★`c.apparentArgumentCount` is the
    ; language service's own override of the argument count and is nil here.
    ;
    ; ★★ IT WRITES BACK INTO THE CANDIDATE LIST — `candidates[bestIndex] =
    ; instantiated` — and that is not bookkeeping: the report pass reads the same
    ; list, so the arity error is measured against the INSTANTIATED signature.
